                            <i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i> Install App as PWA to Enable Push Notifications
                        </h3>
                        <span id="pwaStatusTag" style="font-size: 0.76rem; font-weight: 700; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 12px; background: rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.2); color: #ffc107; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.4);">
                            PWA Required
