                        <div style="font-weight: 700; color: #fff; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 10px;">Step-by-Step Installation Instructions:</div>
                        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; font-size: 0.86rem; color: #ddd; line-height: 1.5;">
                            <div>
                                <strong style="color: var(--gold);"><i class="fab fa-android"></i> Android (Chrome / Edge / Firefox):</strong>
                                <div style="color: var(--silver); margin-left: 20px;">Tap the three dots (⋮) in the browser bar &rarr; Select <strong>"Install app"</strong> or <strong>"Add to Home screen"</strong>.</div>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <strong style="color: #64b5f6;"><i class="fab fa-apple"></i> iOS / iPadOS (Safari):</strong>
                                <div style="color: var(--silver); margin-left: 20px;">Tap the <strong>Share</strong> button (<i class="fas fa-share-square"></i>) in Safari bottom toolbar &rarr; Scroll down and tap <strong>"Add to Home Screen"</strong> (<i class="fas fa-plus-square"></i>) &rarr; Open GPLMods from your Home Screen.</div>
                            </div>
